(UNITED STATES DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE - OFFICE OF PUBLIC AFFAIRS) Tj
T* (FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE - PRESS RELEASE NUMBER 24-817) Tj
T* (Federal Grand Jury Indicts Corporate Executives in Multi-Year Securities) Tj
T* (and Wire Fraud Conspiracy Involving Fabricated Municipal Bond Audits.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (WASHINGTON - A federal grand jury sitting in the Southern District of New York) Tj
T* (returned a fourteen-count indictment today charging three former financial officers) Tj
T* (of Meridian Clearing Partners with conspiracy to commit wire fraud, securities fraud,) Tj
T* (false statements to federal banking regulators, and money laundering across interstate) Tj
T* (wire networks between January 2019 and October 2023.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (According to court documents unsealed this morning, the defendants allegedly created) Tj
T* (fictitious custodial account statements, manipulated quarterly reserve certifications,) Tj
T* (and solicited approximately eighty-four million dollars from pension trustees, municipal) Tj
T* (treasurers, and charitable endowments throughout Massachusetts, Illinois, and Virginia.) Tj
T* (Prosecutors allege that instead of purchasing Treasury-backed municipal securities,) Tj
T* (co-conspirators diverted investor principal into undisclosed shell entities registered) Tj
T* (in Delaware and Nevada to cover prior trading losses and personal real estate mortgages.) Tj
