T* (In a coordinated civil complaint filed simultaneously in Manhattan federal court,) Tj
T* (the Securities and Exchange Commission Division of Enforcement seeks permanent) Tj
T* (injunctive relief, disgorgement of ill-gotten gains with prejudgment interest, civil) Tj
T* (monetary penalties, and permanent officer-and-director bars under the Exchange Act.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Special agents from the Federal Bureau of Investigation New York Field Office,) Tj
T* (together with forensic accountants from the Internal Revenue Service Criminal) Tj
T* (Investigation unit and analysts at the Financial Crimes Enforcement Network, traced) Tj
T* (over six hundred domestic clearinghouse transfers, correspondent bank ledgers, and) Tj
T* (encrypted audit spreadsheets seized pursuant to judicially authorized search warrants.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (An indictment is merely an allegation. All defendants are presumed innocent until) Tj
T* (proven guilty beyond a reasonable doubt in a court of law. Assistant United States) Tj
T* (Attorneys from the Securities and Commodities Fraud Task Force are prosecuting the) Tj
T* (matter. Public docket records are available through PACER under Case No. 1:24-cr-00419.) Tj
